812 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1859 1312 2299 1449]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(THE DOOR SCHDEULE ON THIS SHEET DOES NOT INCLUDE ALL DOOR HARDWARE REQUIRED FOR THIS PROJECT.  THE DOOR SCHEDULE ON THIS SHEET AND THE HARDWARE SCHEDULE FOUND WITHIN SPECIFICATIONS \(DIV 08 74 00\) ONLY DEPICT DOOR HARDWARE WHERE DOORS AND FRAMES ARE BEING REPLACED. CONSULT THE FA SERIES DRAWINGS FOR ADDITIONAL DOOR HARDWARE REQUIRMENTS.   IN THESE INSTANCES, HARDWARE SELECTION IS DELEGATED TO THE CONTRACTOR.  COMPLETE SITE INVESTIGATION AND CONSULT WITH SECURITY INSTALLER TO DETERMINE HARDWARE REQUIREMENTS.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(ZGMKOYVSKDWPOSCA)/M(D:20250228120642-06'00')/AP<</N 9537 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>THE DOOR SCHDEULE ON THIS SHEET DOES NOT INCLUDE ALL DOOR HARDWARE REQUIRED FOR THIS PROJECT.  THE DOOR SCHEDULE ON THIS SHEET AND THE HARDWARE SCHEDULE FOUND WITHIN SPECIFICATIONS \(DIV 08 74 00\) ONLY DEPICT DOOR HARDWARE WHERE DOORS AND FRAMES ARE BEING REPLACED. CONSULT THE FA SERIES DRAWINGS FOR ADDITIONAL DOOR HARDWARE REQUIRMENTS.   IN THESE INSTANCES, HARDWARE SELECTION IS DELEGATED TO THE CONTRACTOR.  COMPLETE SITE INVESTIGATION AND CONSULT WITH SECURITY INSTALLER TO DETERMINE HARDWARE REQUIREMENTS.</p></body>)>>
