1870 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[120 1256 600 1526]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(GENERAL SHEET NOTES: 1. FIRE-RESISTANT RATED BARRIER SHALL BE MAINTAINED. INSTALL FIRE-RESISTANT RATED BARRIER SHALL BE MAINTAINED. INSTALL FIRESTOPPING AND JOINT SEALANTS AS REQUIRED FOR NEW THROUGH AND MEMBRANE PENETRATIONS. SEAL ALL PENETRATIONS ABANDONED AS PART OF THE SCOPE OF WORK. 2. THE REINFORCED CONCRETE SHEER WALL MEASURES 24 INCHES THE REINFORCED CONCRETE SHEER WALL MEASURES 24 INCHES THICK. NO NEW THROUGH PENETRATIONS SHALL BE MADE. EXISTING THROUGH PENETRATIONS AND OPENING SHALL BE USED. SURFACE MOUNT DEVICE MOUNTING MAY BE ALLOWED WITH NPS PRIOR APPROVAL. 3. FIRE ALARM NOTIFICATION DEVICES SHALL BE 15 CANDELA UNLESS FIRE ALARM NOTIFICATION DEVICES SHALL BE 15 CANDELA UNLESS NOTED OTHERWISE. 4. CEILING ARE SUSPENDED LIFT OUT CEILINGS ARE SUSPENDED LIFT CEILING ARE SUSPENDED LIFT OUT CEILINGS ARE SUSPENDED LIFT OUT CEILINGS UNLESS OTHERWISE NOTED AS FOLLOWS:)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(KQVFZFMCDXHMDCVT)/M(D:20250228120643-06'00')/AP<</N 10363 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>GENERAL SHEET NOTES: 1. FIRE-RESISTANT RATED BARRIER SHALL BE MAINTAINED. INSTALL FIRE-RESISTANT RATED BARRIER SHALL BE MAINTAINED. INSTALL FIRESTOPPING AND JOINT SEALANTS AS REQUIRED FOR NEW THROUGH AND MEMBRANE PENETRATIONS. SEAL ALL PENETRATIONS ABANDONED AS PART OF THE SCOPE OF WORK. 2. THE REINFORCED CONCRETE SHEER WALL MEASURES 24 INCHES THE REINFORCED CONCRETE SHEER WALL MEASURES 24 INCHES THICK. NO NEW THROUGH PENETRATIONS SHALL BE MADE. EXISTING THROUGH PENETRATIONS AND OPENING SHALL BE USED. SURFACE MOUNT DEVICE MOUNTING MAY BE ALLOWED WITH NPS PRIOR APPROVAL. 3. FIRE ALARM NOTIFICATION DEVICES SHALL BE 15 CANDELA UNLESS FIRE ALARM NOTIFICATION DEVICES SHALL BE 15 CANDELA UNLESS NOTED OTHERWISE. 4. CEILING ARE SUSPENDED LIFT OUT CEILINGS ARE SUSPENDED LIFT CEILING ARE SUSPENDED LIFT OUT CEILINGS ARE SUSPENDED LIFT OUT CEILINGS UNLESS OTHERWISE NOTED AS FOLLOWS:</p></body>)>>
