2890 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1912 1032 2351 1140]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(DRIVE GROUND ROD\(S\) AND INSTALL WEATHERPROOF JUNCTION BOX AT THE POINT OF CONDUIT ENTRY INTO THE BUILDING. GROUND ROD SHALL BE INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH NATIONAL ELECTRICAL CODE TO ACHIEVE A LOW RESISTANCE GROUND \(<25 OHMS\) INSTALL LOW VOLTAGE SURGE PROTECTIVE DEVICE FOR EACH WIRE PAIR ENTERING THE BUILDING AND CONNECT GROUND WIRE TO NEW GROUND ROD.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(EZRMSPIVDPTYDPLE)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11093 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>DRIVE GROUND ROD\(S\) AND INSTALL WEATHERPROOF JUNCTION BOX AT THE POINT OF CONDUIT ENTRY INTO THE BUILDING. GROUND ROD SHALL BE INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH NATIONAL ELECTRICAL CODE TO ACHIEVE A LOW RESISTANCE GROUND \(&lt;25 OHMS\) INSTALL LOW VOLTAGE SURGE PROTECTIVE DEVICE FOR EACH WIRE PAIR ENTERING THE BUILDING AND CONNECT GROUND WIRE TO NEW GROUND ROD.</p></body>)>>
endobj
2891 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1146 2351 1236]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(INSTALL CAT 6A CABLE FOR POE CAMERA LOCATED WITHIN THE POLE BARN. INSTALL COPPER CONDUCTOR CABLES FOR INTRUSION ALARM ZONES. CABLES SHALL BE CONTINUOUS WITH NO SPLICES BETWEEN POLE BARN AND MAINTENANCE SHOP. CABLES INSTALLED WITHIN CONDUIT SHALL BE RATED FOR DIRECT BURIAL OR WET LOCATION INSTALLATION AND PROVIDED WITH WATER RESISTANT.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(YKQDITLTJTYXKFZN)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11092 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>INSTALL CAT 6A CABLE FOR POE CAMERA LOCATED WITHIN THE POLE BARN. INSTALL COPPER CONDUCTOR CABLES FOR INTRUSION ALARM ZONES. CABLES SHALL BE CONTINUOUS WITH NO SPLICES BETWEEN POLE BARN AND MAINTENANCE SHOP. CABLES INSTALLED WITHIN CONDUIT SHALL BE RATED FOR DIRECT BURIAL OR WET LOCATION INSTALLATION AND PROVIDED WITH WATER RESISTANT.</p></body>)>>
endobj
2892 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1248 2339 1308]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(EXISTING 1 INCH PVC SURFACE MOUNTED CONDUIT TO POLE BARN. REPLACE ABOVE GROUND PORTIONS OF THIS CONDUIT WITH RIGID METALLIC CONDUIT. INSTALL THREADED RIGID TO PVC ADAPTER 6 INCHES ABOVE GRADE LEVEL.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(AWZEABKWQLVPSWXZ)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11091 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>EXISTING 1 INCH PVC SURFACE MOUNTED CONDUIT TO POLE BARN. REPLACE ABOVE GROUND PORTIONS OF THIS CONDUIT WITH RIGID METALLIC CONDUIT. INSTALL THREADED RIGID TO PVC ADAPTER 6 INCHES ABOVE GRADE LEVEL.</p></body>)>>
