2893 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1318 2362 1440]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(RECONFIGURE EXISTING DEDICATED 120 VAC POWER AS REQUIRED AND IN ACCORDANCE WITH MANUFACTURER'S INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS AND IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE NATIONAL ELECTRICAL CODE. INSTALL SURGE PROTECTION DEVICE WITHIN ENCLOSURE WITHIN 3 FEET OF THE ALARM CONTROL UNIT AND TIE DIRECTLY TO BUILDING GROUND. IF PLUG IN TRANSFORMER IS TO BE USED, IT SHALL BE PLACED WITHIN METALLIC ENCLOSURE TO PREVENT TAMPERING AND ACCIDENTAL UNPLUGGING.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(TBIZXSOBJFVVQWVM)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11090 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>RECONFIGURE EXISTING DEDICATED 120 VAC POWER AS REQUIRED AND IN ACCORDANCE WITH MANUFACTURER'S INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS AND IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE NATIONAL ELECTRICAL CODE. INSTALL SURGE PROTECTION DEVICE WITHIN ENCLOSURE WITHIN 3 FEET OF THE ALARM CONTROL UNIT AND TIE DIRECTLY TO BUILDING GROUND. IF PLUG IN TRANSFORMER IS TO BE USED, IT SHALL BE PLACED WITHIN METALLIC ENCLOSURE TO PREVENT TAMPERING AND ACCIDENTAL UNPLUGGING.</p></body>)>>
