3094 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1050 2350 1158]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(DRIVE GROUND ROD\(S\) AND INSTALL WEATHERPROOF JUNCTION BOX AT THE POINT CONDUIT ENTRY INTO THE BUILDING. GROUND ROD SHALL BE INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH NATIONAL ELECTRICAL CODE TO ACHIEVE A LOW RESISTANCE GROUND \(<25 OHMS\) INSTALL LOW VOLTAGE SURGE PROTECTIVE DEVICE FOR EACH WIRE PAIR ENTERING THE BUILDING AND CONNECT GROUND WIRE TO NEW GROUND ROD.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(BQNOJCRBOELLCOQM)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11218 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>DRIVE GROUND ROD\(S\) AND INSTALL WEATHERPROOF JUNCTION BOX AT THE POINT CONDUIT ENTRY INTO THE BUILDING. GROUND ROD SHALL BE INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH NATIONAL ELECTRICAL CODE TO ACHIEVE A LOW RESISTANCE GROUND \(&lt;25 OHMS\) INSTALL LOW VOLTAGE SURGE PROTECTIVE DEVICE FOR EACH WIRE PAIR ENTERING THE BUILDING AND CONNECT GROUND WIRE TO NEW GROUND ROD.</p></body>)>>
endobj
3095 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1171 2364 1261]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(INSTALL CAT 6 CABLE FOR POE CAMERA. INSTALL COPPER CONDUCTOR CABLES FOR INTRUSION ALARM ZONES. CABLES SHALL BE CONTINUOUS WITH NO SPLICES BETWEEN COLD STORAGE BUILDING AND MAINTENANCE SHOP. CABLES INSTALLED WITHIN CONDUIT SHALL BE RATED FOR DIRECT BURIAL OR WET LOCATION INSTALLATION AND PROVIDED WITH WATER RESISTANT JACKET.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(KCBCMLRGJOKPNJND)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11217 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>INSTALL CAT 6 CABLE FOR POE CAMERA. INSTALL COPPER CONDUCTOR CABLES FOR INTRUSION ALARM ZONES. CABLES SHALL BE CONTINUOUS WITH NO SPLICES BETWEEN COLD STORAGE BUILDING AND MAINTENANCE SHOP. CABLES INSTALLED WITHIN CONDUIT SHALL BE RATED FOR DIRECT BURIAL OR WET LOCATION INSTALLATION AND PROVIDED WITH WATER RESISTANT JACKET.</p></body>)>>
endobj
3096 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1270 2357 1426]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(INSTALL NEW PERSONNEL DOOR AND OVERHEAD DOOR CONTACTS AT EACH DOOR. INSTALL ALL WIRING WITHIN METALLIC CONDUIT, WITH A METALLIC JUNCTION BOX \(HANDI-BOX OR SIMILAR\) PLACED WITHIN 12 IN OF EACH SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACT. SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACTS SHALL BE FACTORY EQUIPPED WITH  METALLIC ARMOR CORD TO PROTECT WIRING. SECURE ARMOR CORD TO JUNCTION BOX WITH ROMEX CLAMP OR SIMILAR CABLE CLAMP. WIRE TERMINATIONS SHALL BE MADE USING SCREWED TERMINAL STRIPS. THE USE OF GRIPPED BEAM CONNECTORS, WIRENUTS, TWISTLOCK, SCOTCHLOCK \(TM\), ETC. CONNECTORS SHALL BE PROHIBITED.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(SZULNDUGEKTWALPW)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11216 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>INSTALL NEW PERSONNEL DOOR AND OVERHEAD DOOR CONTACTS AT EACH DOOR. INSTALL ALL WIRING WITHIN METALLIC CONDUIT, WITH A METALLIC JUNCTION BOX \(HANDI-BOX OR SIMILAR\) PLACED WITHIN 12 IN OF EACH SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACT. SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACTS SHALL BE FACTORY EQUIPPED WITH  METALLIC ARMOR CORD TO PROTECT WIRING. SECURE ARMOR CORD TO JUNCTION BOX WITH ROMEX CLAMP OR SIMILAR CABLE CLAMP. WIRE TERMINATIONS SHALL BE MADE USING SCREWED TERMINAL STRIPS. THE USE OF GRIPPED BEAM CONNECTORS, WIRENUTS, TWISTLOCK, SCOTCHLOCK \(TM\), ETC. CONNECTORS SHALL BE PROHIBITED.</p></body>)>>
endobj
