3383 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1911 1118 2357 1271]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(INSTALL NEW PERSONNEL DOOR AND OVERHEAD DOOR CONTACTS AT EACH DOOR. INSTALL ALL WIRING WITHIN METALLIC CONDUIT, WITH A METALLIC JUNCTION BOX \(HANDI-BOX OR SIMILAR\) PLACED WITHIN 12 IN OF EACH SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACT. SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACTS SHALL BE FACTORY EQUIPPED WITH METALLIC ARMOR CORD TO PROTECT WIRING. SECURE ARMOR CORED TO JUNCTION BOX WITH ROMEX CLAMP OR SIMILAR CABLE CLAMP. WIRE TERMINATIONS SHALL BE MADE USING SCREWED TERMINAL STRIPS. THE USE OF GRIPPED BEAM CONNECTORS, WIRENUTS, TWISTLOCK, SCOTCHLOCK \(TM\), ETC. CONNECTORS SHALL BE PROHIBITED.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(FRBOTQGQQWFNNOOZ)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 11445 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>INSTALL NEW PERSONNEL DOOR AND OVERHEAD DOOR CONTACTS AT EACH DOOR. INSTALL ALL WIRING WITHIN METALLIC CONDUIT, WITH A METALLIC JUNCTION BOX \(HANDI-BOX OR SIMILAR\) PLACED WITHIN 12 IN OF EACH SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACT. SURFACE MOUNT DOOR CONTACTS SHALL BE FACTORY EQUIPPED WITH METALLIC ARMOR CORD TO PROTECT WIRING. SECURE ARMOR CORED TO JUNCTION BOX WITH ROMEX CLAMP OR SIMILAR CABLE CLAMP. WIRE TERMINATIONS SHALL BE MADE USING SCREWED TERMINAL STRIPS. THE USE OF GRIPPED BEAM CONNECTORS, WIRENUTS, TWISTLOCK, SCOTCHLOCK \(TM\), ETC. CONNECTORS SHALL BE PROHIBITED.</p></body>)>>
endobj
