4636 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1912 822 2360 1204]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(UTILIZE SPACES IN EXISTING PANEL TO PROVIDE POWER TO NEW HEATED/VENTILATED ENCLOSURES HOUSING ALARM CONTROL UNIT.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.  ALL CIRCUITS SHOULD USE #12 COPPER CONDUCTORS IN 3/4" CONDUIT.  ENCLOSURE HOUSING AND INTRUSION ALARM CONTROL PANEL SHALL BE EQUIPPED WITH A DUPLEX OUTLET TO POWER THE CONTROL UNIT. CONTRACTOR TO RECONFIGURE AND RE-USE EXITING CIRCUIT FOR ALARM CONTROL UNIT.  COORDINATE WITH THE FIRE ALARM AND INTRUSION ALARM CONTRACTOR.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.   UTILIZE SPACES IN EXISTING PANELS TO PROVIDE POWER TO ALARM SYSTEM AUXILIARY POWER SUPPLIES, ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM, LOCKING HARDWARE POWER SUPPLIES, CAMERA HEATER/BLOWER POWER SUPPLIES, ETC.  NOT ALL EQUIPMENT IS SHOWN, AS EQUIPMENT QUANTITIES AND LOCATIONS WILL BE DETERMINED BY THE FIRE/INTRUSION ALARM SYSTEM, ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM AND VIDEO SURVEILLANCE SYSTEM CONTRACTOR.  COORDINATE WITH THE FIRE/INTRUSION ALARM SYSTEM, ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM AND VIDEO SURVEILLANCE SYSTEM CONTRACTOR.  ALL CIRCUITS SHOULD USE #12 COPPER CONDUCTORS IN 3/4" CONDUIT.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.  )/Border[0 0 0]/NM(NIYKSQJIJZUKDDZE)/M(D:20250228120644-06'00')/AP<</N 12385 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>UTILIZE SPACES IN EXISTING PANEL TO PROVIDE POWER TO NEW HEATED/VENTILATED ENCLOSURES HOUSING ALARM CONTROL UNIT.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.  ALL CIRCUITS SHOULD USE #12 COPPER CONDUCTORS IN 3/4" CONDUIT.  ENCLOSURE HOUSING AND INTRUSION ALARM CONTROL PANEL SHALL BE EQUIPPED WITH A DUPLEX OUTLET TO POWER THE CONTROL UNIT. CONTRACTOR TO RECONFIGURE AND RE-USE EXITING CIRCUIT FOR ALARM CONTROL UNIT.  COORDINATE WITH THE FIRE ALARM AND INTRUSION ALARM CONTRACTOR.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.   UTILIZE SPACES IN EXISTING PANELS TO PROVIDE POWER TO ALARM SYSTEM AUXILIARY POWER SUPPLIES, ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM, LOCKING HARDWARE POWER SUPPLIES, CAMERA HEATER/BLOWER POWER SUPPLIES, ETC.  NOT ALL EQUIPMENT IS SHOWN, AS EQUIPMENT QUANTITIES AND LOCATIONS WILL BE DETERMINED BY THE FIRE/INTRUSION ALARM SYSTEM, ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM AND VIDEO SURVEILLANCE SYSTEM CONTRACTOR.  COORDINATE WITH THE FIRE/INTRUSION ALARM SYSTEM, ACCESS CONTROL SYSTEM AND VIDEO SURVEILLANCE SYSTEM CONTRACTOR.  ALL CIRCUITS SHOULD USE #12 COPPER CONDUCTORS IN 3/4" CONDUIT.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.  </p></body>)>>
endobj
