7128 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1912 1352 2356 1467]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(UTILIZE SPACES IN EXISTING PANEL TO PROVIDE POWER TO NEW HEATED/VENTILATED ENCLOSURES HOUSING RF TRANSMITTER/RECEIVER AND INTRUSION ALARM CONTROL UNIT.  ENCLOSURE HOUSING POWER SUPPLY SHALL BE EQUIPPED WITH A DUPLEX OUTLET TO POWER THE CONTROL UNIT.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.  ALL CIRCUITS SHOULD USE #12 COPPER CONDUCTORS IN 3/4" CONDUIT. )/Border[0 0 0]/NM(YHULTPUFVGUGOYRA)/M(D:20250228120645-06'00')/AP<</N 13107 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>UTILIZE SPACES IN EXISTING PANEL TO PROVIDE POWER TO NEW HEATED/VENTILATED ENCLOSURES HOUSING RF TRANSMITTER/RECEIVER AND INTRUSION ALARM CONTROL UNIT.  ENCLOSURE HOUSING POWER SUPPLY SHALL BE EQUIPPED WITH A DUPLEX OUTLET TO POWER THE CONTROL UNIT.  PROVIDE EACH CIRCUIT WITH A NEW 20/1 BREAKER TO MATCH EXISTING.  ALL CIRCUITS SHOULD USE #12 COPPER CONDUCTORS IN 3/4" CONDUIT. </p></body>)>>
