7360 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[1912 702 2358 807]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(INSTALL MINIMUM 1-IN RIGID CONDUIT BETWEEN THE COLD STORAGE BUILDING AND THE EVIDENCE CONNEX. CONDUIT SHALL ENTER AND EXIT STRUCTURE WITHIN 12 INCHES OF GRADE LEVEL. CONDUIT SHALL BE TERMINATED AT THE COLD STORAGE BUILDING AND EVIDENCE CONNEX USING LR AND LL CONDUIT BOXES, RESPECTIVELY. THE BOX OPENINGS SHALL FACE WEST. THE CONDUIT SHALL ALSO CONNECT TO THE METALLIC RACEWAY WITHIN EACH STRUCTURE.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(STOOEPLRGXZKMIKV)/M(D:20250228120645-06'00')/AP<</N 13463 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>INSTALL MINIMUM 1-IN RIGID CONDUIT BETWEEN THE COLD STORAGE BUILDING AND THE EVIDENCE CONNEX. CONDUIT SHALL ENTER AND EXIT STRUCTURE WITHIN 12 INCHES OF GRADE LEVEL. CONDUIT SHALL BE TERMINATED AT THE COLD STORAGE BUILDING AND EVIDENCE CONNEX USING LR AND LL CONDUIT BOXES, RESPECTIVELY. THE BOX OPENINGS SHALL FACE WEST. THE CONDUIT SHALL ALSO CONNECT TO THE METALLIC RACEWAY WITHIN EACH STRUCTURE.</p></body>)>>
